{"product_id":"ever-after-high-fairys-got-talent-a-school-story","title":"Ever After High: Fairy's Got Talent (A School Story)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe fourth hexciting book in Suzanne Selfors' Ever After High: A School Story series.Keeping up evil appearances is hexhausting work for Faybelle Thorn. But as the daughter of the legendary Dark Fairy, it's all part of her story. So when Justine Dancer is looking for a fairy to audition for a part in her new play, Faybelle's not interested...until she finds out the role is that of a wicked fairy queen. It's the role of Faybelle was born to play, and there's no way she's going to wait in the wings and let some other fairy play it! Faybelle soon finds out that she's actually got some pretty stiff competition for the part, so she resorts to drastic measures to land it: dark magic. But when her dark magic spell is an epic fairy fail, it's up to Faybelle to do the fight thing...What's a dark fairy to do?© 2015 Mattel. All Rights Reserved.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Suzanne Selfors\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780316401432\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45578838638745,"sku":"16RA-3-9780316401432","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/687679cd7eb65-Ever-After-High-Fairy-s-Got-Talent-A-School-Story-Suzanne-Selfors-_1.jpg?v=1753120484","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/ever-after-high-fairys-got-talent-a-school-story","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}